    """Fictional fixtures for the P2 run log's control pairs (specs/0013, "Harness
    runs"): the tool is run on each and the two checks must hold on its output,
    and every plant must turn its flag.
    
    Usage: fixtures.py <dir>   writes c-af-chain.xlsx, c-a-nof.xlsx, c-neither.xlsx
    
    c-af-chain  A and F, a calculation chain, an Excel-style calcPr (calcId alone)
    c-a-nof     A and no F, no chain, a LibreOffice-style calcPr (four attributes)
    c-neither   no Number cell (so no A), a normal formula with a string result,
                a chain, which the tool must leave in place
    Every value and text here is fictional.
    """
